# NexusLink Implementation Plan

Implement this repo as `nexuslink/` inside this workdir. Do one stage at a time.

## Stage 1 - Monorepo scaffold
Create structure:
- apps/desktop (Tauri 2.0 host)
- apps/mobile-client (Next.js 14 PWA)
- packages/rpc-types
- packages/gesture-engine
- packages/ui-components
- sidecar

Root: Bun workspace, turbo.json, package.json with workspaces.
Desktop: scaffold Tauri 2.0 with Bun manager and identifier com.nexuslink.desktop, remove default frontend.
Mobile: scaffold Next.js 14 App Router in TS.
Packages: bun init -y, main: src/index.ts.
Stop when scaffold exists.

## Stage 2 - Tauri + Next.js wiring
Desktop: set build.devUrl=localhost:3000, beforeDevCommand=bun run dev, beforeBuildCommand=bun run build.
Window size 1200x800, title "NexusLink Host".
Install Tauri plugins: shell, fs, http, notification. Register in main.rs.
Create minimal Next.js smoke page showing NexusLink Host — Connected.

## Stage 3 - Sidecar scaffold
sidecar: cargo init --name nexuslink-sidecar.
Deps: serde+derive, tokio full, anyhow.
stdin/stdout JSON-RPC loop. Method ping returns pong. All others return not implemented error.
Bundle in Tauri as externalBin with shell:allow-spawn and shell:allow-execute.
cargo build --release succeeds.

## Stage 4 - RPC types
packages/rpc-types/src/index.ts exports:
- RpcMethod union
- RpcRequest<RpcMethod>
- RpcResponse<any>
- Method-specific mapped Params/Result types
- FileEntry, ProcessEntry, TerminalSession, SystemInfo, PerfSnapshot
- WsMessage discriminated union

## Stage 5 - Tauri IPC commands
desktop/src-tauri/src/commands/mod.rs
commands/fs.rs stubs: list_directory, read_file, write_file, delete_path -> not implemented.
commands/process.rs stubs: list_processes, kill_process.
commands/sidecar.rs: spawn nexuslink-sidecar via shell plugin, bridge JSON-RPC with ID correlation.
Register in main.rs.

## Stage 6 - RPC server
desktop/src/server/rpc-server.ts: Bun.serve WebSocket, sessions map, dispatch router defaulting to not implemented.
handlers/fs.ts: fs.list using Bun.fs returning FileEntry list.
handlers/process.ts: Linux /proc parser and Windows tasklist CSV parser.
desktop/src/server/index.ts: startRpcServer(port).
desktop package.json script: bun run src/server/index.ts

## Stage 7 - Terminal PTY
sidecar deps: portable-pty=0.8, uuid.
terminal.rs: create_terminal returns session UUID. Write stdin bytes, resize, kill.
On session creation spawn reader, forward PTY output as JSON on stdout with type terminal-output.
Desktop dispatches terminal.create/input/resize/kill to sidecar and forwards terminal-output to the matching WebSocket.

## Stage 8 - Mobile PWA
mobile-client:
- PWA config, manifest.json, dark theme layout.
- lib/rpc-client.ts: WebSocket client, auto-reconnect, typed request/response correlation with timeout.
- store/connection.ts: Zustand reconnect/session state.
- layout.tsx PWA meta + ConnectionProvider reading hostUrl from localStorage.
- page.tsx connect form + Component/Mirror launcher screen.

## Stage 9 - Mobile components
terminal/page.tsx: xterm + FitAddon, terminal.create, terminal-input/resize/kill wiring, mobile toolbar.
files/page.tsx: navigation, list/grid, hidden toggle, pull-to-refresh, delete confirmation.
processes/page.tsx: polling 3s, sort/search, force kill sheet.
system/page.tsx: system.getInfo, perf sparklines, perf-update subscription.
mirror/page.tsx: video element, quality/FPS selector, gesture overlay stub.

## Stage 10 - Gestures
packages/gesture-engine/src/GestureEngine.ts: pure TS touch analyzer.
Mappings: tap=left click, two-tap=right click, two-finger tap=middle, pan=mouse move, pinch/pan=scroll, long press=right click, coordinate scaleToHost.
src/components/GestureOverlay.tsx wrapper over mirror video.

## Stage 11 - Sidecar input + screen capture
sidecar/Cargo.toml: enigo, scap, base64, webrtc.
input.rs: send_to_sidecar bridges input.mouse*, input.keyEvent to OS.
capture.rs: start_capture emits base64 JPEG stream-frames on stdout. stop_capture ends stream.
Routes wired to sidecar JSON-RPC dispatch.

## Stage 12 - WebRTC signaling
desktop/src/server/signaling.ts: /signal WS path, RTCPeerConnection, ICE trickle.
Sidecar frame reader bridges stream-frame events to video track.

## Stage 13 - Auth
desktop/src/server/auth/pairing.ts: ECDH P-256, HKDF-SHA256, TOTP, session token store, heartbeat expiry.
Mobile client performs handshake, stores session token, attaches to messages. Redirect on unauthorized.

## Stage 14 - Relay + perf
apps/relay: dumb byte forwarder on 8787, Dockerfile, room expiry 60s.
desktop/src/server/handlers/system.ts: getInfo/getPerf.
perf-broadcaster.ts: perf-update every 1s.
